## Sub-ticket breakdown (per boss authorize B)

### ticket 35a — Model curated to 5 + rename + tier field

Scope:
1. `Sources/WenshuApp/Core/Provider/Provider.swift` — add `tier: ModelTier?` field on `Provider` struct
   - New enum `ModelTier: String, Codable { case ultra, med }`
2. `Sources/WenshuApp/Core/Agent/MiniMaxModel.swift` — curate `defaultModels` to 5 (drop -highspeed variants)
3. `Sources/WenshuApp/Core/Provider/ProviderCatalog.swift` — rename model display names:
   - `MiniMax-M3` → `MiniMax M3 Ultra`
   - `MiniMax-M2.7` → `MiniMax M2.7 Med`
   - `MiniMax-M2.5` → `MiniMax M2.5 Med`
   - `MiniMax-M2.1` → `MiniMax M2.1 Med`
   - `MiniMax-M2` → `MiniMax M2 Med`
4. `Sources/WenshuApp/App.swift` ChatZoneView model picker Menu label = `"{name} · {tier}"` format
5. Curate logic: dropdown shows `live API models filtered by !contains "-highspeed"` (=5 from8) PLUS tier display name
6. Refresh model button (manual API call, bypass 1h cache)

Why first: smallest scope (1 commit), biggest visual impact (boss sees 5-model curated dropdown immediately)

### ticket 35b — ChatSettings store + 思考 toggle + 推理强度 picker

Scope:
1. `Sources/WenshuApp/State/ChatSettings.swift` (NEW FILE) — `@MainActor` ObservableObject with:
   - `@Published var thinkingEnabled: Bool` (default false)
   - `@Published var reasoningEffort: ReasoningEffort` (default .ultra)
   - `enum ReasoningEffort: String, Codable, CaseIterable { case minimal, low, medium, high, veryHigh, max, ultra }`
   - Display labels: minimal="最小", low="低", medium="中", high="高", veryHigh="极高", max="最高", ultra="超高"
   - Persisted via `@AppStorage`
2. Settings UI panel in `Sources/WenshuApp/Views/Settings/SettingsView.swift`:
   - 思考 Toggle (.toggle(...))
   - 推理强度 Picker (7 levels)
3. Edit model... button → sheet with custom JSON model list

