## Q32 root cause audit (verified live API data)

`MiniMaxModelFetcher.fetchLiveModelIds` returns8 model IDs (verified via NSLog capture):
```
MiniMax-M3, MiniMax-M2.7, MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed, MiniMax-M2.5, MiniMax-M2.5-highspeed, MiniMax-M2.1, MiniMax-M2.1-highspeed, MiniMax-M2
```

Hermes drops the3 `-highspeed` variants → curated5. Display name transform `MiniMax-M3` → `MiniMax M3 Ultra` (remove dash + add tier suffix).

