## 5 principles (Q26, all 3 sub-tickets)

1. Apple official paradigm: Toggle + Picker + AppStorage + Apple Anthropic thinking/reasoning_effort fields
2. Pseudo-Apple official style: SF Symbol icons + semantic colors
3. Effect priority: split into 3 smaller commits (boss authorized B)
4. Business language: "思考 + 推理强度 + 5 model curated", boss understands
